Changes made by designloves2 (2026-11):
  - Node ids, class names, module and file names, display names, categories, log prefixes and the web extension name
    were renamed so this pack and the original one can be installed side by side:
      KimchyH3ZeroSplitMP   -> TJLatentUpscaleTiledMP   ("H3 Latent Upscale Tiled (TJ)")
      KimchyH3ZeroSplitV2   -> TJLatentUpscaleTiledV2   ("H3 Latent Upscale Tiled V2 (TJ)")
      KimchyH3DualScheduler -> TJH3DualScheduler        ("H3 Dual Scheduler (TJ)")
  - tj_latent_upscale_tiled_mp.py, TJLatentUpscaleTiledMP / forward_feather_adaptive: the window is computed on the
    model's device instead of the input's device, and a clip no longer than one window is moved there too. For large
    targets (latent area above 10000, about 2.56 MP) the input is kept on the CPU on purpose to save VRAM; the window then
    ran as a CPU tensor through the GPU network and failed with "Expected all tensors to be on the same device".
